    <string name="guide_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="guide_body">1. Stand 30–60 cm from the boxes; AUTO picks the zoom.\n\n2. Sweep slowly from top to bottom. Each counted box beeps and gets a green frame.\n\n3. Volume key = Pause / Resume. Undo = remove the last box (long press: the last sweep).\n\n4. Finish → check the list → send to the PC → click DİA\'s barcode field on the computer.</string>
